---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SEO from "../components/SEO.astro";
const LAST_UPDATED = "2026-09-21";
---
<BaseLayout>
  <SEO slot="head" title="Terms & Disclaimer | Embedded & Circuits" description="Terms of use and content disclaimer." path="/terms/" />
  <div class="prose-container article-body" style="padding: var(--space-8) 0;">
    <h1>Terms &amp; Disclaimer</h1>
    <p class="text-muted">Last updated: {LAST_UPDATED}</p>

    <p><strong>This is a template, not legal advice.</strong> Adjust it to fit your situation.</p>

    <h2>Content disclaimer</h2>
    <p>
      Articles on this site cover electronics and embedded-systems projects
      involving live circuits, power sources, and microcontrollers. Content is
      provided for educational purposes only, "as is," without warranty of
      any kind. Building or wiring circuits carries inherent risk of damage
      to equipment, fire, or injury. Follow all safety guidance for the
      components you use, and work at your own risk.
    </p>

    <h2>No professional advice</h2>
    <p>
      Nothing on this site constitutes professional engineering, electrical,
      or safety advice. For commercial or safety-critical projects, consult a
      qualified engineer.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-party content and links</h2>
    <p>
      This site may link to third-party sites, datasheets, or products. I am
      not responsible for the content or availability of external sites.
    </p>

    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>
      Unless otherwise noted, article text and original images are © the
      author. Code samples in articles may be reused freely unless a specific
      license is noted in that article.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>These terms may be updated as the site evolves; the "last updated" date above will reflect the latest revision.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
